  "files": [
    {
      "path": "index.html",
      "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>Pixel Counter</title>\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"styles.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"card\" aria-label=\"Pixel counter\">\n    <h1>Pixel Counter</h1>\n    <output id=\"count\" aria-live=\"polite\" aria-atomic=\"true\">0</output>\n    <div class=\"controls\">\n      <button id=\"decrease\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Decrease count\">-</button>\n      <button id=\"increase\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Increase count\">+</button>\n      <button id=\"reset\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Reset count to zero\">Reset</button>\n    </div>\n  </main>\n  <script src=\"script.js\"></script>\n</body>\n</html>",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "styles.css",
      "content": ":root {\n  --bg: #1a1a2e;\n  --card: #16213e;\n  --accent: #e94560;\n  --text: #f0f0f0;\n  --muted: #a0a0b0;\n}\n\n* {\n  box-sizing: border-box;\n}\n\nbody {\n  margin: 0;\n  min-height: 100vh;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  background: var(--bg);\n  font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif;\n  font-size: 18px;\n  color: var(--text);\n  padding: 1rem;\n}\n\n.card {\n  background: var(--card);\n  border: 4px solid var(--accent);\n  border-radius: 0;\n  padding: 2rem 2.5rem;\n  text-align: center;\n  box-shadow: 8px 8px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);\n  image-rendering: pixelated;\n  max-width: 100%;\n}\n\nh1 {\n  margin: 0 0 1.5rem;\n  font-size: 1.6rem;\n  letter-spacing: 2px;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  color: var(--accent);\n}\n\n#count {\n  display: block;\n  font-size: 4rem;\n  font-weight: bold;\n  margin: 0 0 2rem;\n  min-width: 6ch;\n  color: var(--text);\n  font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;\n  line-height: 1;\n}\n\n.controls {\n  display: flex;\n  gap: 0.75rem;\n  justify-content: center;\n  flex-wrap: wrap;\n}\n\nbutton {\n  font-family: inherit;\n  font-size: 1.1rem;\n  font-weight: bold;\n  padding: 0.75rem 1.25rem;\n  min-width: 3.5rem;\n  color: var(--bg);\n  background: var(--text);\n  border: 3px solid var(--text);\n  border-radius: 0;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  box-shadow: 4px 4px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6);\n  transition: background 0.1s, transform 0.05s, box-shadow 0.05s;\n}\n\nbutton:hover {\n  background: var(--accent);\n  border-color: var(--accent);\n  color: var(--text);\n}\n\nbutton:focus-visible {\n  outline: 4px solid var(--accent);\n  outline-offset: 3px;\n}\n\nbutton:active {\n  transform: translate(3px, 3px);\n  box-shadow: 1px 1px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6);\n}\n\n#reset {\n  background: var(--muted);\n  border-color: var(--muted);\n}\n\n#reset:hover {\n  background: var(--accent);\n  border-color: var(--accent);\n  color: var(--text);\n}\n\n@media (max-width: 400px) {\n  .card {\n    padding: 1.5rem;\n  }\n  #count {\n    font-size: 3rem;\n  }\n  button {\n    font-size: 1rem;\n    padding: 0.6rem 1rem;\n  }\n}",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "script.js",
      "content": "const countEl = document.getElementById('count');\nconst increaseBtn = document.getElementById('increase');\nconst decreaseBtn = document.getElementById('decrease');\nconst resetBtn = document.getElementById('reset');\n\nlet count = 0;\n\nfunction render() {\n  countEl.textContent = String(count);\n}\n\nincreaseBtn.addEventListener('click', () => {\n  count += 1;\n  render();\n});\n\ndecreaseBtn.addEventListener('click', () => {\n  count -= 1;\n  render();\n});\n\nresetBtn.addEventListener('click', () => {\n  count = 0;\n  render();\n});\n\nrender();",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "README.md",
      "content": "# Pixel Counter\n\nAn offline, dependency-free pixel-style counter web app.\n\n## Features\n\n- Initial value: `0`\n- Increase (`+`), decrease (`-`), and reset buttons\n- Supports negative numbers\n- Keyboard-accessible labeled buttons\n- Pixel-art aesthetic with a cohesive palette\n- Responsive down to 360px wide\n- No storage, no network requests, no external assets\n\n## Usage\n\nOpen `index.html` in any modern browser. Click the buttons to change the count.\n\n- **Increase** (`#increase`): adds 1\n- **Decrease** (`#decrease`): subtracts 1\n- **Reset** (`#reset`): sets count to 0\n\nThe current value is displayed in the `#count` output element.\n\n## Accessibility\n\n- Buttons are focusable and activatable via keyboard (Enter/Space)\n- Visible focus outlines\n- `aria-live` on the count output for screen readers\n- Buttons have descriptive `aria-label` attributes\n\n## Files\n\n- `index.html` — markup\n- `styles.css` — pixel theme and responsive layout\n- `script.js` — counter logic\n\nTotal source under 200 lines. No build step required.",
      "description": ""
    }
  ]
